Transparency you can dial, and a background that is not a wallpaper
=================================================================

Two things were asked for and both are settings now rather than a look I picked.

**Transparency.** There was a translucent-panels switch and nothing to control the degree of it. There
is a Panel opacity slider (100% solid down to 40%), stored as a preference, applied through a
`--panel-alpha` custom property that the translucent surfaces read. At the default of 100% nothing
changes; nothing is translucent behind your back.

**Background.** Two optional layers drawn by the app itself, not a wallpaper and not a video:

  * a slow radial drift in the accent colour, 38 seconds, alternating — off by default
  * an optional grid overlay, masked to a soft circle, for the people who like the drafting-table look

Both are `body::before` / `body::after` with `pointer-events: none` and the app's surfaces lifted above
them, so they cannot swallow a click. `prefers-reduced-motion` disables the animation rather than the
whole effect.
diff -Naur /tmp/mk35/a38/resources/ui/app.css /tmp/mk35/b/resources/ui/app.css
--- a/resources/ui/app.css
+++ b/resources/ui/app.css
@@ -2312,7 +2312,7 @@
   :root[data-translucent="on"] .panel,
   :root[data-translucent="on"] .settings-content,
   :root[data-translucent="on"] .toolbar {
-    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--panel) 86%, transparent);
+    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--panel) calc(var(--panel-alpha, 1) * 100%), transparent);
     -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
     backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
   }
@@ -2391,3 +2391,45 @@
 .storage-files td { padding: 4px 8px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
 .storage-files td:first-child { color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; }
 .storage-files code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 11px; }
+
+/* Background: drawn by the app, off unless asked for. A slow drift plus an optional grid, both
+   sitting behind everything and excluded from hit-testing. */
+body::before, body::after {
+  content: "";
+  position: fixed;
+  inset: -20%;
+  pointer-events: none;
+  z-index: 0;
+  opacity: 0;
+  transition: opacity .6s ease;
+}
+:root[data-background-motion="on"] body::before {
+  opacity: 1;
+  background:
+    radial-gradient(46% 38% at 18% 28%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, transparent), transparent 70%),
+    radial-gradient(52% 44% at 82% 72%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 11%, transparent), transparent 72%);
+  animation: drift 38s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
+}
+:root[data-background-grid="on"] body::after {
+  opacity: 1;
+  background-image:
+    linear-gradient(to right, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px),
+    linear-gradient(to bottom, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 8%, transparent) 1px, transparent 1px);
+  background-size: 44px 44px;
+  mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #000 0%, transparent 78%);
+  -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, #000 0%, transparent 78%);
+}
+@keyframes drift {
+  from { transform: translate3d(-3%, -2%, 0) scale(1); }
+  to   { transform: translate3d(4%, 3%, 0) scale(1.08); }
+}
+@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
+  :root[data-background-motion="on"] body::before { animation: none; }
+}
+/* the app's own surfaces sit above the backdrop */
+.shell { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
+
+/* settings rows */
+.slider-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr 54px; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 8px 0 4px; font-size: 13px; }
+.slider-row input[type="range"] { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--accent); }
+.slider-value { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); text-align: right; }
